# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# The local counterpart of the device's own /data/media: whatever has been
# uploaded there, which is never this repo's business. The folder itself
# stays, so the layout survives a fresh clone (see the Makefile, which only
# ever creates it on the device).
data/media/*
!data/media/.gitkeep

# The keyboard's own filesystem as a development machine gets to have
# one: what a setup wrote, at the paths the device writes it to —
# `board/data/network` for its `/data/network`, `board/var/lib/iwd` for
# its `/var/lib/iwd` (see KBRD-API's `dev_server.py`).
#
# None of it is this repository's business: it is one machine's idea of
# one keyboard, and the iwd profile in it carries the network's key in
# clear, exactly as the keyboard's does. The folder builds itself on the
# first save, so there is nothing to keep here for a fresh clone.
board/
